<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Foot Step — Account deletion</title><style>body{font:16px/1.7 system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;color:#24392f;background:#faf9f5}main{max-width:680px;padding:40px 24px;margin:auto}h1{line-height:1.2}a{color:#a73f1f}section{margin:30px 0}li{margin:10px 0}</style></head><body><main><a href="https://footsteponline.com">Foot Step</a><h1>Delete your Foot Step account</h1><section><h2>From the Android app</h2><ol><li>Sign in to your customer account.</li><li>Open <strong>Accounts → Delete account</strong>.</li><li>Read what will be removed, enter your current password and confirm.</li></ol><p>Your sign-in, profile, saved addresses, cart, wishlist, reviews and app sessions are deleted immediately. Your name, contact and shipping address are removed from completed/cancelled order records. Anonymous order numbers, items and totals remain as business records.</p><p>If you have an active order, first arrange completion or cancellation with Foot Step so delivery and refunds can be resolved safely. Admin accounts cannot be removed through the customer deletion flow.</p></section><section><h2>Request deletion without the app</h2><p>Contact Foot Step using the details below. Say “Foot Step account deletion request” and identify the email or phone used for your account. <strong>Never send your password.</strong> Support will verify ownership before processing the request. If an active order prevents immediate deletion, support can help resolve it.</p>@if($email)<p><a href="mailto:{{ $email }}?subject=Foot%20Step%20account%20deletion%20request">Request account deletion by email</a><br>{{ $email }}</p>@endif @if($phone)<p><a href="tel:{{ $phone }}">Contact Foot Step support: {{ $phone }}</a></p>@endif</section><p><a href="https://footsteponline.com/api/mobile/v1/privacy">Privacy policy</a></p></main></body></html>
